      "subject": "Capture review: ECHO-73",
      "shortSummary": "Review the focused capture and record its endpoints before interpreting the flow.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "{player},\n\nReview the focused ECHO-73 capture in Wireshark, then verify its endpoints with tcpdump. Record the source, destination, protocol, and direction before deciding what the traffic means.\n\nWe need a defensible observation, not speculation.\n\nAsterlink SOC",
